    "Ground and path are already darkened sRGB native art. Avoid applying MapForest legacy Grade twice.",
    "Point/Nearest. Keep tile edges aligned to integer pixels. Actual display sizes and click regions need host-side validation.",
    "No characters, standing art, BGM, key visuals, src/engine, src/data, or Unity code changed."
